"""
Kaldi Training Set Visualization — HTML Output
- Labels inferred from spk_id (normal / abnormal keywords)
- Multi-shard ark support via feats.scp
- Statistical outlier annotation (IQR / Z-score / bivariate)
- Single-file interactive HTML output

Usage:
    python3 visualize_dataset.py \
        --data-dir  data/fbank_20k_test5/fiber_train_s10_fix105_20k \
        --feats-dir feats_exp/feats/fbank_20k_test5/fiber_train_s10_fix105_20k \
        --output-dir ./vis_output \
        [--scp-name feats.scp] \
        [--sample-per-class 2000] \
        [--normal-keyword normal] \
        [--abnormal-keyword abnormal]
"""

